WEBVTT

00:02:07.640 --> 00:02:13.730
The match to decide who's going
to the finals is about to start!

00:02:25.080 --> 00:02:28.160
The players take the stage!

00:02:30.040 --> 00:02:35.420
Emperors of the four-man battle!
Will F-Sangre make their way to the finals?

00:02:35.420 --> 00:02:40.590
Or will the BBA take this
chance to get their revenge?

00:02:44.430 --> 00:02:48.310
Will the BBA Revolution
fight Neo-Borg

00:02:48.310 --> 00:02:50.940
who already got
their ticket to the finals,

00:02:50.940 --> 00:02:53.050
Or will it be F-Sangre?

00:02:54.520 --> 00:02:57.030
Are you ready?

00:02:58.740 --> 00:03:01.450
This is a home
match for the BBA!

00:03:01.610 --> 00:03:06.830
Even Kinomiya's grandfather made it to the stands to cheer him on!

00:03:07.120 --> 00:03:09.580
He's right! Grandpa!

00:03:13.380 --> 00:03:16.460
Cut it out, Daichi!
That's embarrassing!

00:03:17.170 --> 00:03:18.300
Pipe down!

00:03:18.300 --> 00:03:21.630
BBA members, are you ready?

00:03:21.630 --> 00:03:23.090
Yes, sir!

00:03:23.340 --> 00:03:27.770
This is the stadium that they'll
have their showdown in!

00:03:42.660 --> 00:03:47.450
This is the Dragon Stadium, the
perfect fit for their final battle!

00:03:47.450 --> 00:03:51.460
I hope the audience
appreciates the oriental appeal!

00:03:51.460 --> 00:03:55.250
In accordance with the
BBA team's request,

00:03:55.250 --> 00:03:58.050
this match will be
a four-man battle!

00:04:01.590 --> 00:04:03.590
A four-man battle!

00:04:03.590 --> 00:04:06.050
I'm looking forward to this!

00:04:10.430 --> 00:04:13.900
He wants his revenge.
That's Takao for you.

00:04:13.900 --> 00:04:14.850
Yeah.

00:04:15.230 --> 00:04:20.320
It's safe to say this battle will determine who's the best at four-man battles.

00:04:20.650 --> 00:04:25.070
Their opponents will be F-Sangre, the
undefeated rulers of the four-man battle.

00:04:25.070 --> 00:04:28.780
Will this choice be their
blessing or their curse?

00:04:29.450 --> 00:04:32.830
What's his deal?
It's obviously a blessing!

00:04:32.830 --> 00:04:38.590
Yeah! Let's prove we're the
best at four-man battles!

00:04:38.590 --> 00:04:41.630
Time to start the battle!

00:04:41.630 --> 00:04:47.140
Who's going to be the
ruler of the four-man battle?!

00:04:48.470 --> 00:04:51.770
Here we go,
Dragoon Galaxy Turbo!

00:05:01.320 --> 00:05:03.150
Are you ready?

00:05:03.990 --> 00:05:07.030
Three! Two! One!

00:05:07.280 --> 00:05:10.520
--Go, Shoot!
--Go, Shoot!

00:05:12.080 --> 00:05:15.160
Let's wrap this up fast, Raul!

00:05:15.160 --> 00:05:17.210
Okay, sis!

00:05:20.340 --> 00:05:21.750
Here I come!

00:05:25.880 --> 00:05:28.140
But we avoided
a direct attack!

00:05:28.140 --> 00:05:31.220
It's not just faster,
but more powerful, too!

00:05:31.220 --> 00:05:32.720
Now, Daichi!

00:05:34.310 --> 00:05:35.980
Watch out, sis!

00:05:41.730 --> 00:05:45.280
There it is! The BBA comes
flying out the gate!

00:05:45.990 --> 00:05:48.280
Daichi has good team work,

00:05:48.280 --> 00:05:53.490
but one has to acknowledge the power
of Takao's Dragoon Galaxy Turbo!

00:05:53.740 --> 00:05:57.120
Their playstyle doesn't even
compare to last time!

00:05:57.120 --> 00:06:00.420
As fierce as the
azure dragon itself!

00:06:00.710 --> 00:06:03.250
The new Dragoon is incredible.

00:06:03.250 --> 00:06:07.380
Of course! Attack power,
speed, balance--

00:06:07.380 --> 00:06:09.930
They're all top-level
with no weaknesses!

00:06:09.930 --> 00:06:12.720
That's Dragoon Galaxy Turbo!

00:06:14.640 --> 00:06:15.890
Sis!

00:06:18.560 --> 00:06:20.810
You're not going anywhere!

00:06:32.280 --> 00:06:37.460
The BBA's on fire! They've got
F-Sangre on defense!

00:06:37.460 --> 00:06:40.460
This is impossible!

00:06:40.670 --> 00:06:44.670
We can't keep up with
them in a four-man battle...

00:06:44.670 --> 00:06:45.880
Shut up!

00:06:47.920 --> 00:06:51.470
We should not be losing!

00:06:52.140 --> 00:06:54.390
Sis! Keep your cool!

00:06:54.390 --> 00:06:56.430
Don't bug me, Raul!

00:06:58.350 --> 00:07:01.150
They've completely
lost their groove.

00:07:01.690 --> 00:07:05.520
The champion's Bey is
way too strong, though.

00:07:09.780 --> 00:07:13.410
Come on!

00:07:13.990 --> 00:07:15.330
Too easy!

00:07:17.450 --> 00:07:20.750
Is Julia out of the stadium
with one hit from Dragoon?

00:07:22.500 --> 00:07:23.880
Yes!

00:07:25.250 --> 00:07:26.250
Sis!

00:07:32.970 --> 00:07:38.220
No! Raul saves Julia
just in the nick of time!

00:07:41.730 --> 00:07:43.690
Let's do it, sis!

00:07:47.570 --> 00:07:49.360
Get back here!

00:08:05.880 --> 00:08:06.920
Let's go!

00:08:06.920 --> 00:08:08.130
Yeah!

00:08:15.800 --> 00:08:17.350
Fuerza...

00:08:17.760 --> 00:08:19.640
Valiente!

00:08:21.810 --> 00:08:23.980
Two can play at that game!

00:08:23.980 --> 00:08:25.600
Great--

00:08:31.440 --> 00:08:32.490
Daichi!

00:08:38.660 --> 00:08:39.700
What?!

00:08:50.050 --> 00:08:55.800
Wonderful! F-Sangre uses their
brilliant teamwork to counter the BBA!

00:08:55.800 --> 00:08:58.930
This battle is
back to square one!

00:09:00.850 --> 00:09:02.390
Fantastic!

00:09:02.390 --> 00:09:04.810
He used his
special move as bait!

00:09:04.810 --> 00:09:07.480
Yeah, that's pretty good!

00:09:07.480 --> 00:09:09.820
Stop that, sis!

00:09:10.480 --> 00:09:13.610
Taking that kind of power
head-on is too dangerous.

00:09:13.610 --> 00:09:17.360
We need to
coordinate more carefully.

00:09:18.530 --> 00:09:20.530
Are you listening to me?

00:09:21.410 --> 00:09:24.080
You've become a
lot more aggressive.

00:09:24.080 --> 00:09:26.170
Oh, sorry.
I didn't mean to.

00:09:26.170 --> 00:09:27.880
No, that's fine.

00:09:27.880 --> 00:09:29.590
You man, you!

00:09:30.170 --> 00:09:31.710
Let's go, Raul.

00:09:31.710 --> 00:09:33.380
Let's fight back.

00:09:33.380 --> 00:09:34.590
Okay!

00:09:34.590 --> 00:09:37.260
Those jerks! Pulling out
weird moves like that.

00:09:37.260 --> 00:09:38.550
The two of them...

00:09:38.550 --> 00:09:41.430
They had moves
like that all along!

00:09:41.430 --> 00:09:43.430
They're good.

00:09:44.390 --> 00:09:49.270
So let's show 'em a move that'll
really knock their socks off.

00:09:49.270 --> 00:09:51.650
That's the spirit!
Let's do it, Daichi!

00:09:55.070 --> 00:10:02.950
"Bakuten Shoot Beyblade G-Revolution"

00:10:08.670 --> 00:10:10.380
Why you...!

00:10:18.130 --> 00:10:20.510
The tables are being turned!

00:10:20.510 --> 00:10:22.220
Indeed...!

00:10:22.560 --> 00:10:26.640
Takao and Daichi clearly have the
upper hand in speed and power.

00:10:26.930 --> 00:10:31.520
And their teamwork is in
perfect form this time around.

00:10:31.690 --> 00:10:33.110
So why...?

00:10:33.110 --> 00:10:34.360
It's the gap in experience.

00:10:34.360 --> 00:10:35.610
Experience?

00:10:35.610 --> 00:10:40.030
The two of them have lived and
fought together since they were young.

00:10:40.410 --> 00:10:42.780
They've already developed.

00:10:42.780 --> 00:10:45.370
The feel for their techniques,
their refinement...

00:10:45.370 --> 00:10:48.660
Takao and Daichi can't even
compare to their talent.

00:10:49.040 --> 00:10:52.250
Power versus talent.
I wonder which one will win?

00:10:52.250 --> 00:10:54.420
We don't know how
this match will end.

00:11:01.800 --> 00:11:02.550
Crap!

00:11:02.550 --> 00:11:03.760
I got it!

00:11:14.190 --> 00:11:15.860
Takao!

00:11:18.780 --> 00:11:19.900
--What?!

00:11:21.160 --> 00:11:22.320
Dragoon!

00:11:28.120 --> 00:11:30.290
You got off easy.

00:11:30.290 --> 00:11:32.250
Don't relax just yet!

00:11:32.250 --> 00:11:33.540
Takao, watch out!

00:11:34.000 --> 00:11:35.170
Above!

00:11:38.760 --> 00:11:40.130
Time to do it, Daichi!

00:11:40.130 --> 00:11:41.130
Yeah!

00:11:42.300 --> 00:11:44.970
--Dragon Tank!!
--Dragon Tank!!

00:11:58.730 --> 00:12:01.030
What an amazing
display of moves!

00:12:01.030 --> 00:12:03.160
In the air and
on the ground!

00:12:03.160 --> 00:12:06.660
It's like a museum
displaying their best moves!

00:12:06.660 --> 00:12:10.080
It's a two-for-one sale
on special moves!

00:12:10.080 --> 00:12:12.830
I feel like I'm watching a
real circus performance.

00:12:12.830 --> 00:12:16.600
It's like the four of them are on
the same team to give us a show!

00:12:16.600 --> 00:12:18.450
This is thrilling!

00:12:18.450 --> 00:12:22.560
Yes. But the pressure it
puts on them is rough.

00:12:22.560 --> 00:12:27.160
It may look nice on the surface, but it puts an incredible strain on their strength and stamina!

00:12:27.160 --> 00:12:30.640
You're right. But that's what
makes this so much fun to watch!

00:12:30.640 --> 00:12:34.400
This match has been
going on for a while now!

00:12:34.400 --> 00:12:37.270
But the intensity
keeps increasing!

00:12:37.270 --> 00:12:41.570
Is there a limit to the skill
displayed in this battle?!

00:12:41.570 --> 00:12:44.150
Running out of steam, Takao?

00:12:44.410 --> 00:12:46.160
I am not!

00:12:46.160 --> 00:12:48.910
And you're
drenched in sweat!

00:12:48.910 --> 00:12:51.200
My head's tired out!

00:12:51.200 --> 00:12:53.790
'Cuz they use all
these weird moves!

00:12:53.790 --> 00:12:56.330
This battle is a tough one.

00:12:56.330 --> 00:12:58.130
What're you smiling for?

00:12:58.130 --> 00:13:00.960
This reminds me
of their battle.

00:13:01.340 --> 00:13:05.300
Blanking out your mind and
charging in with all you've got.

00:13:05.300 --> 00:13:11.770
Max and Rei's teams fought a similar battle--
That feels more like a festival...

00:13:26.860 --> 00:13:31.620
It's weird, right? The battle is tough
but so much fun I can't help it!

00:13:32.370 --> 00:13:33.540
Exciting, eh?

00:13:33.540 --> 00:13:36.830
I'm having so much
fun I can't stand it!

00:13:36.830 --> 00:13:40.590
Right? So let's have
some more fun, Daichi!

00:13:40.590 --> 00:13:43.500
Damn right! Let's go!

00:13:50.100 --> 00:13:50.890
Sis...

00:13:50.890 --> 00:13:54.140
This is pathetic...
The match isn't even over yet!

00:13:54.140 --> 00:13:56.480
Move!
I have to move!

00:13:56.520 --> 00:13:58.440
--Sangre!!

00:14:02.690 --> 00:14:04.360
We made it!

00:14:04.360 --> 00:14:07.320
Let's yell real loud!

00:14:08.570 --> 00:14:11.080
--Sangre! Sangre!

00:14:11.080 --> 00:14:14.660
Wow! We've got quite the
unexpected cheering section!

00:14:14.660 --> 00:14:16.000
All of them...
--Sangre! Sangre!

00:14:16.000 --> 00:14:19.120
They came all
this way for us!

00:14:19.120 --> 00:14:20.500
Doink and Rodrigo!

00:14:20.500 --> 00:14:22.590
Look! Pero's here, too!

00:14:22.710 --> 00:14:26.340
They should be busy
doing performances...

00:14:27.800 --> 00:14:31.220
I'm not tired anymore!

00:14:31.220 --> 00:14:32.300
Right!

00:14:32.300 --> 00:14:38.520
Come on, Raul. Let's show
them our greatest Beybattle yet!

00:14:38.520 --> 00:14:40.270
You got it, sis!

00:14:42.730 --> 00:14:45.070
Wonderful...

00:14:46.690 --> 00:14:49.450
They used to be
so small and clumsy...

00:14:50.240 --> 00:15:03.960
One, two, one two...

00:15:03.960 --> 00:15:06.170
Don't let go!

00:15:08.720 --> 00:15:12.260
Don't cry! You won't
get better by crying!

00:15:12.260 --> 00:15:14.350
We gotta keep practicing!

00:15:14.350 --> 00:15:16.270
Let's do it over!

00:15:16.270 --> 00:15:17.890
Sis...

00:15:18.230 --> 00:15:21.440
One, two, one, two...

00:15:21.690 --> 00:15:24.060
They've grown up so much.

00:15:24.060 --> 00:15:28.490
And now they're fighting
on the world stage...

00:15:29.030 --> 00:15:31.110
Julia... Raul...

00:15:31.610 --> 00:15:36.160
Look! The world is
watching you both!

00:15:45.880 --> 00:15:49.630
F-Sangre has
completely taken control...

00:15:49.630 --> 00:15:52.970
There's only one way
to turn this around.

00:15:52.970 --> 00:15:55.180
But can you do it?

00:15:56.140 --> 00:15:58.390
What do we do, Takao?

00:15:58.390 --> 00:16:00.640
I'm trying to
figure that out!

00:16:01.890 --> 00:16:04.440
Teach me a good move!

00:16:06.110 --> 00:16:09.440
We've shown you
plenty of good moves.

00:16:09.440 --> 00:16:11.450
You can use
whatever ones you want.

00:16:11.450 --> 00:16:13.240
We don't charge tuition.

00:16:13.820 --> 00:16:16.620
What?!
Don't make fun of us!

00:16:16.620 --> 00:16:18.160
Chill out, Daichi!

00:16:18.160 --> 00:16:20.620
We could never use their--

00:16:21.040 --> 00:16:23.500
Wait... Yes!

00:16:24.540 --> 00:16:25.750
What's gotten into you?!

00:16:25.750 --> 00:16:27.170
Listen to me, Daichi!

00:16:28.550 --> 00:16:31.380
What?! Really?
Can we do that?

00:16:31.380 --> 00:16:32.930
How should I know?

00:16:32.930 --> 00:16:36.300
But if we nail it,
it'd be really cool!

00:16:36.300 --> 00:16:38.060
You're right!

00:16:38.060 --> 00:16:39.310
Let's do it!

00:16:39.310 --> 00:16:41.810
The look in their
eyes has changed.

00:16:41.810 --> 00:16:43.890
Doesn't matter what they do.

00:16:43.890 --> 00:16:46.270
We'll fight back with
our strongest move.

00:16:46.270 --> 00:16:47.900
That's all!

00:16:49.520 --> 00:16:52.320
This showdown of special
moves has made a turn!

00:16:52.320 --> 00:16:57.620
They're staring each other down!
Which team is gonna go for the finish?!

00:16:57.620 --> 00:17:01.080
Sangre! Sangre!!

00:17:01.080 --> 00:17:03.540
We're gonna win this in one shot!

00:17:03.540 --> 00:17:05.330
Yeah, I got it!

00:17:05.330 --> 00:17:07.880
Be our guests.
Bring it on!

00:17:07.880 --> 00:17:08.790
Come on!

00:17:08.790 --> 00:17:11.050
Go!!

00:17:17.760 --> 00:17:19.760
They really did
use our move...

00:17:19.760 --> 00:17:24.100
I'd compliment them,
but they're wide open.

00:17:24.100 --> 00:17:26.060
Their timing is all off!

00:17:27.810 --> 00:17:29.520
Ram 'em, Daichi!

00:17:29.520 --> 00:17:30.730
Yeah!!

00:17:31.070 --> 00:17:35.280
Great Cutter!!

00:17:46.250 --> 00:17:47.290
Let's go up the ramp!

00:17:47.290 --> 00:17:48.420
Okay!

00:17:50.540 --> 00:17:51.590
They dodged it!

00:17:51.590 --> 00:17:52.710
Yes!

00:17:55.760 --> 00:17:57.180
He went up!

00:17:57.180 --> 00:17:59.510
Let's finish him with
a team attack!

00:18:01.220 --> 00:18:02.930
Daichi, now!

00:18:02.930 --> 00:18:04.020
Yeah!

00:18:10.270 --> 00:18:11.900
Shoot me up!

00:18:21.240 --> 00:18:22.410
Dodge, Raul!

00:18:22.410 --> 00:18:23.830
I can't, it's too fast!

00:18:23.830 --> 00:18:27.620
Galaxy Turbo Twister!!

00:19:06.370 --> 00:19:08.120
It's over!!

00:19:08.120 --> 00:19:14.750
The Pegasus in the skies! The invincible tag siblings,
F-Sangre, have finally been taken down!

00:19:14.750 --> 00:19:21.090
The BBA Revolution gets their revenge
in a tag-battle and make it to the finals!

00:19:21.090 --> 00:19:27.100
The matchups for the finals will be
the BBA Revolution VS Neo-Borg!

00:19:33.690 --> 00:19:40.450
We can't forget F-Sangre's rise through
the ranks against such strong rival teams!

00:19:40.450 --> 00:19:43.160
Thank you, F-Sangre!

00:19:45.830 --> 00:19:49.620
They needed to think
outside the box to win.

00:19:49.620 --> 00:19:53.080
And the courage
to risk it all.

00:19:53.080 --> 00:19:56.550
Well done, Takao! Daichi!

00:19:56.550 --> 00:20:01.340
I never thought that was a
strategy to speed up his Bey...

00:20:01.340 --> 00:20:04.550
And then they used the dragon
statue as a launching pad...

00:20:06.260 --> 00:20:08.680
We didn't make
it to the finals.

00:20:08.680 --> 00:20:12.350
Yeah.
I wanted more applause.

00:20:16.060 --> 00:20:18.860
Good job!
Good job you two!

00:20:18.860 --> 00:20:20.990
That was amazing!

00:20:20.990 --> 00:20:24.030
You guys are
great entertainers!

00:20:38.340 --> 00:20:43.430
What's important is that you did
everything you could to play your best.

00:20:43.430 --> 00:20:45.840
Doesn't matter
if you win or lose.

00:20:48.640 --> 00:20:49.970
Coach...

00:20:49.970 --> 00:20:52.310
Raul's gonna cry again!

00:20:52.310 --> 00:20:54.480
What are you crying for?

00:20:54.480 --> 00:20:56.440
Keep it together!

00:20:56.610 --> 00:20:58.690
You're crying too!

00:20:58.690 --> 00:21:00.900
Because of you!

00:21:04.450 --> 00:21:08.580
What a blast!
I'm beat, though!

00:21:08.580 --> 00:21:12.540
Yeah, right? To use a
special move as bait...

00:21:12.540 --> 00:21:16.630
I would have never thought of it unless we fought them.

00:21:17.040 --> 00:21:19.540
I'd love to
battle them again.

00:21:19.540 --> 00:21:20.800
Yeah!

00:22:56.380 --> 00:22:58.890
The finals of the world
championships are finally upon us.

00:22:58.890 --> 00:23:00.780
How I've waited for this
moment, Daichi Sumeragi!

00:23:00.780 --> 00:23:04.400
I'm going to pay you back for the shame you brought upon me! With interest!

00:23:04.400 --> 00:23:09.810
What's the matter, monkey boy? Don't run! Attack me like you normally would!

00:23:09.810 --> 00:23:11.400
Shut up!

00:23:11.400 --> 00:23:14.930
I've got my reasons!
Hurry up, Takao!

00:23:14.930 --> 00:23:16.820
If you take too
long I'm gonna lose!

00:23:16.820 --> 00:23:18.940
Are you done yet?!

00:23:18.940 --> 00:23:21.420
I can't hold on much longer!
